File: contrib/dbs/xtiff/xtiff.c
Line: 878
Function: GetTIFFImage
Bug type: integer-overflow-to-heap-buffer-overflow
CWE: CWE-190
Explanation: The allocation size tfBytesPerRow * 4 * tfImageHeight + 4 can overflow. The subsequent unpack loop writes ~4 * ceil(tfImageWidth/4) bytes per row for tfImageHeight rows, overrunning the undersized buffer if the multiplication wrapped.

